Assignment
Only handwritten file will be accepted.
1. Simplify and verify these Boolean expressions.
a. ACD+A’BCD = ACD+BCD
b. AB’+ABC’+AB’C’D = AB’+AC’
c. (A+B)(A+C) = A+BC
d. AB’C+A’BC+A’B’C+A’B’C’+AB’C’ = B’+A’C
e. ((AB)’+A’+AB)’ = 0
2. Implement AND, OR, NOT, Buffer, NOR, XOR, XNOR gates using NAND gate.
3. Implement AND, OR, NOT, Buffer, NAND, XOR, XNOR gates using NOR gate.
4. Express F in minterms or sum of products (SOP) and maxterms or product of sum (POS).
F(A, B, C) = A+BC’
5. Simplify (Minimize) the followings Boolean functions in SOP form and POS form.
a. F(X, Y, Z) = Ʃm (0, 2, 4, 5, 6)
b. F(W, X, Y, Z) = Ʃm (0, 1, 2, 4, 5, 6, 8, 9, 12, 13, 14)
c. F(W, X, Y, Z) = Ʃm (3, 4, 5, 7, 9, 13, 14, 15)
d. F(W, X, Y, Z) = Ʃm (0, 1, 2, 5, 8, 10, 15) + Ʃd (3, 6, 7, 11)
e. F(W, X, Y, Z) = Ʃm (0, 4, 6, 7, 10, 12, 13, 14)
f. F(A, B, C, D) = Σm (0, 2, 5, 7, 8, 10, 13, 15)
g. F(A, B, C, D) = Σm (1, 3, 4, 5, 9, 11, 12, 13)
h. F(A, B, C, D) = Σm (0, 1, 2, 5, 8, 9, 10, 13) + Σd (3, 11, 15)
i. F(A, B, C, D) = Σm (2, 3, 6, 7, 10, 11, 14, 15)
j. F(A, B, C, D) = Σm (0, 1, 4, 5, 8, 9, 12, 13, 14)
k. F(A, B, C, D) = Σm (0, 2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 12, 14) + Σd (1, 3, 5, 7)
l. F(A, B, C, D, E) = Ʃm (0, 2, 4, 6, 9, 11, 13, 15, 17, 21, 25, 27, 29, 31)
m.F(A, B, C, D, E) = Ʃm (0, 1, 2, 4, 5, 6, 10, 13, 14, 18, 21, 22, 24, 26, 29, 30)
n. F(A, B, C, D, E) = Ʃm (0, 2, 4, 6, 9, 11, 13, 15, 17, 21, 25, 27, 29, 31)
o. F(A, B, C, D, E) = Σm (0, 1, 2, 3, 16, 17, 18, 19, 8, 9, 10, 11, 24, 25, 26, 27)
p. F(A, B, C, D, E) = Σm (2, 3, 6, 7, 10, 11, 14, 15, 18, 19, 22, 23, 26, 27, 30, 31)
q. F(A, B, C, D, E) = Σm (1, 3, 5, 7, 17, 19, 21, 23, 9, 11, 13, 15) + Σd (0, 2, 4, 6, 16, 18, 20, 22)
6. Design and implement the logic circuit for the following 4-bit code conversion.
a. Binary to Gray Code
b. Gray to Binary Code
7. Design and implement the logic circuit for the following 4-bit code conversion.
a. BCD to Excess-3 Code
b. Excess-3 Code to BCD
8. Design and implement the logic circuit that detect whenever BCD code is greater than 5.
a. Invalid conditions are don’t care.
b. Invalid conditions are zero.
9. Design and implement the logic circuit of BCD to 7 segment display.
10. Make a 8x1 MUX from two 4x1 MUX and one OR gate.
11. Make a 8x1 MUX from two 4x1 MUX and one 2x1 MUX.
12. Implement using 8x1 MUX, F(A, B, C) = Ʃm (0, 1, 5, 7).
13. Implement using 4x1 MUX, F(A, B, C) = Ʃm (1, 3, 5, 6)
a. Making A as input.
b. Making B as input.
c. Making C as input.
